      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like a possible pneumonia on the right side. A pulmonary embolism is still possible. We should do a sputum culture for pneumonia. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step.",
